Completes the 799a0a71 checkpoint: the panda C compiled only with the pedal-fault
declaration moved above hyundai_common_init; the FCA11-long window's cooldown
check no longer fires from a phantom ts_act_end=0 on a fresh arm; carstate_ext
produces the CS inputs the controller reads; get_pid_accel_limits override;
capnp fca11Brake field; alert + UI + params key (sp repo). Safety suite: 4439
passed / 780 skipped / 0 failed (Fca11Long class 289 passed, 16 skipped).
---
